	(text "Since AH180-WG have an open-drain outupt and output pin pulled up,\nsingal from a hall senssor which always in magnet field should be inverted\nBut at the same time sensor that should initialize fail if magnet detected \nshould go direct.\nThus, the TAMPER_SET signal will be positive only in case of tampering. \nThrough config registers tamper detection can be adjusted \nup to 4 different combinations."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 178.562 103.124 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "dd70524f-5c2a-490b-acdb-7db85dfb335c")
	)
